FreeGraduates AI Resume Builder — backend module

Adapted portions of this module (LangGraph workflow architecture,
structured-resume schema, PDF extraction strategy, and the four rule
layers under `app/data/rules/`) are derived from

    haderalva/ai-resume-builder
    https://github.com/haderalva/ai-resume-builder

which is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial
4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0).

